    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broth Bounty</strong> is a fast-paced 2D shooter inspired by classic lightgun games, with a chaotic culinary twist! As a shotgun-wielding chef, you must restore order to kitchens across the country, where ingredients have gone rogue. Restaurants are counting on you to tame the madness and cook up the perfect soups for hungry customers. Aim carefully, make every shot count, and avoid hitting the wrong ingredients\u2014your bullets are limited, and the pressure is on! Shooting the wrong ingredients can have dire consequences...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Wacky, unpredictable ingredients</strong> \u2013 Shoot rampaging veggies, flying chickens, and more!<br>\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Epic boss fights</strong> \u2013 Face off against monster-sized kitchen abominations.<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Randomized roguelite maps</strong>\u00a0<strong>and levels</strong> \u2013 No two kitchens are ever the same.<br>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Upgradeable arsenal &amp; abilities</strong> \u2013 Enhance your skills and weaponry to survive the culinary chaos.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broth Bounty</strong> is a fast-paced 2D shooter inspired by classic lightgun games, with a chaotic culinary twist! As a shotgun-wielding chef, you must restore order to kitchens across the country, where ingredients have gone rogue. Restaurants are counting on you to tame the madness and cook up the perfect soups for hungry customers. Aim carefully, make every shot count, and avoid hitting the wrong ingredients\u2014your bullets are limited, and the pressure is on! Shooting the wrong ingredients can have dire consequences...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Wacky, unpredictable ingredients</strong> \u2013 Shoot rampaging veggies, flying chickens, and more!<br>\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Epic boss fights</strong> \u2013 Face off against monster-sized kitchen abominations.<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Randomized roguelite maps</strong>\u00a0<strong>and levels</strong> \u2013 No two kitchens are ever the same.<br>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Upgradeable arsenal &amp; abilities</strong> \u2013 Enhance your skills and weaponry to survive the culinary chaos.</p>",
